														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4294894">
									

<p>While this is a good premise and there's horror here to be found, this was a -1 from me. As it stands, there are some issues with the tone and this article just comes out and hits you in the face with a lot of its details, like the ripping off the skin bit. In addition, there are several spots throughout where the author has chosen to bring in &quot;will never&quot; and other such strong and generally non-clinical language.</p>
<p>Why is the spleen being removed? I see later in the article that this appears to be the seat of the spore production so that makes sense, but if someone has a fungal infection, removing the spleen is likely a death sentence.</p>

							</div>

								
