																		Touch-up the interview log
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/angle-fish" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6442926); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6442926&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607200768" alt="Angle_Fish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6442926)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/angle-fish" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6442926); return false;" >Angle_Fish</a></span> <span class="odate time_1589485827 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">14 May 2020 19:50</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4646982">
									

<p>Considering this was your first SCP it's not bad at all. Very formal tone throughout, although the part where you brush up on the immune system was a bit odd on how it was described.</p>
<p>&quot;<em>The immune system always ignores the fungus, and the reason for this is as of yet unknown</em>&quot;</p>
<p>I feel like the foundation wouldn't just leave it at that, if anything it would say something along the lines of:</p>
<p>&quot;<em>The reason for this is currently under review</em>&quot; or &quot;<em>The reason for this is due to the development of acute Immunodeficiency within the subject</em>&quot;</p>
<p>In regards to the interview log the subject's speech shifts in tone many times.</p>
<p>&quot;<em>I was always carrier. There was never a time I didn't have it in me</em>&quot; could be shifted to &quot;<em>I always carrier, always inside me</em>&quot;</p>
<p>Just odd shifts in vocab, like saying intelligence and then switching to smartest. But overall, it was a nice read. +1 because I liked it and I don't think it should be on the lowest rated category.</p>

							</div>

										<div class="signature">
					<hr class="signature-separator"/>
					

<p>I hear you, shining one! I await your commands. Another quest, I pray you! I am ready.</p>

				</div>
					
					
